@title Famicom Mini - Famicom Tantei Club - Kieta Koukeisha Zenkouhen (Japan)
@file Famicom Mini - Vol. 27 - Famicom Tantei Club - Kieta Koukeisha Zenkouhen (J) [o1].gba
@game FTKJ
@chip EEPROM 4Kbit
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba
@save skip: the game has no save command in its opening (the L+R menu has only つづける / リセット / スリープモード; the command list is きく / しらべる / おもいだす), and the first disk save comes later in the story, past the interrogation by Amachi, whose topics loop under A; not reached within the time box. The 512-byte EEPROM written here holds only the 8 bytes "NAT_U..." at 0xF8, from the boot.

# The Disk System version. Title (ちょうさ かいし), START, the fiction
# disclaimer, A through the opening (the accident, waking at Amachi's), the
# first choice menu (あまちのこと / じぶんのこと), A through it to the command
# list, DOWN to しらべる > じぶんのからだ and A through its text.
# All three emulators showed the same frames at every look while authoring.
[new]
wait 300
wait 300
checkpoint title window=30
press A
wait 120
press START
wait 180
wait 600
checkpoint disclaimer window=30
press A
wait 300
tap A times=10 every=90 hold=6
checkpoint intro window=30
tap A times=20 every=90 hold=6
wait 120
checkpoint amachi window=30
tap A times=30 every=60 hold=6
checkpoint commands window=30
press DOWN
wait 20
press A
wait 60
tap A times=12 every=60 hold=6
checkpoint examine window=30

